1871:Theorem and_shr_shru:
1872-  forall x y z,
1873-  and (shr x z) (shru y z) = shru (and x y) z.
1874-Proof.
1875-  intros. apply same_bits_eq; intros.
1876-  rewrite bits_and; auto. rewrite bits_shr; auto. rewrite !bits_shru; auto.
1877-  destruct (zlt (i + unsigned z) zwordsize).
1878-  - rewrite bits_and; auto. generalize (unsigned_range z); lia.
1879-  - apply andb_false_r.
