2516:Theorem shr_and_is_shru_and:
2517-  forall x y z,
2518-  lt y zero = false -> shr (and x y) z = shru (and x y) z.
2519-Proof.
2520-  intros. apply shr_shru_positive. apply and_positive.
2521-  unfold lt in H. rewrite signed_zero in H. destruct (zlt (signed y) 0). congruence. auto.
2522-Qed.
